This question resembles QServe (symmetric activation quantization, KV quantization) or "ECCV"… actually, the NeurIPS 2024 paper "KV Cache Is 1 Bit Per Channel" is NeurIPS 2024 (KIVI is ICML 2024). KVQuant is NeurIPS 2024: "KVQuant: 1-bit attention" — non-uniform, per-channel. Hmm. Paper 94328 track 2 — unclear. I'll keep this as an open question.

Now, I'll present a plan with stage=plan. Contents to include:
