- Feasibility: CPU-only. 224 cores, 2 TB RAM. LLAMA-2-7B fp16 = 13 GB. Estimate CPU throughput. Estimate the number of evaluation tokens needed for stable ppl (e.g., 1–2M tokens… may be too much for CPU. Use the WikiText-2 test of about 250K tokens, which gives sufficient stability). Compute budget assumption: e.g., about 24–48 hours wall-clock across all configurations with 224 threads.

